{"id":"b3268cfaf8","t":"The Saint Levels Up Through Necromancy","c":"cv","n":42,"l":70,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy"},"u":1795376388761,"desc":"بعد خروجه من برنامج “الترفيه النجمي” وفشله حتى في بلوغ رتبة الكهنوت الإلهي (النجم الأسود)، رُشِّح تشينين ريوغا، بجهوده الذاتية، لأعلى رتبة، وهي “النجوم التسعة”. إلا أن المتسامين والطُعم، الذين يمتلكون القدرات اللازمة، تآمروا عليه وقتلوه. وبتوجيه من المقدسين، النجم الأسود والنجم الأسود، أصبح هدفه الوحيد في هذه الحياة الجديدة هو الانتقام من الأساتذة المتغطرسين الذين قتلوه ثلاث مرات كممثلين لعصر النهضة. وهكذا، بدأت بصيرته، التي تجمع بين معرفة السابقين وبركة الأساتذة، ترتقي إلى مستواه بسرعة فائقة!","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن"],"src":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy/1/","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|"},"2":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy/2/","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|"},"3":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy/3/","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|"},"4":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy/4/","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|"},"5":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy/5/","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|"},"6":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy/6/","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|"},"7":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy/7/","mg":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|"},"8":{"ml":"the-saint-levels-up-through-necromancy|/manga/the-sai